<main class="ams-landing"><nav class="ams-landing-nav"><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index" class="ams-brand"><span class="ams-brand-mark">A</span><span class="ams-brand-copy"><strong>AMS</strong><small>Assignment Management System</small></span></a><div><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="PublicClasses">Explore classes</a><a asp-controller="Assignments" asp-action="PublicTemplates">Assignments</a><a asp-controller="Auth" asp-action="Login" class="ams-button ams-button-outline">Sign in</a><a asp-controller="Auth" asp-action="Register" class="ams-button">Join as student</a></div></nav><section class="ams-hero"><div class="ams-hero-copy"><span class="ams-eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-stars"></i> LEARN · ASSIGN · IMPROVE</span><h1>Every assignment,<br /><em>in one place.</em></h1><p>Discover subject classes, submit your work, and get feedback. Teachers manage assignments and evaluate submissions from one focused workspace.</p><div class="ams-hero-actions"><a asp-controller="Auth" asp-action="Register" class="ams-button ams-button-lg">Start learning <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right"></i></a><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="PublicClasses" class="ams-text-link">Browse public classes <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a></div><div class="ams-hero-meta"><span><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Class registration</span><span><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Assignment feedback</span><span><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> AI practice</span></div></div><div class="ams-hero-visual"><div class="ams-visual-glow"></div><article class="ams-preview-card"><div class="ams-preview-top"><span class="ams-preview-icon"><i class="bi bi-journal-bookmark-fill"></i></span><span class="ams-pill ams-pill-green">IN PROGRESS</span></div><small>YOUR WORKSPACE</small><h2>Assignments</h2><p>Keep your class work moving forward.</p><div class="ams-preview-row"><span class="ams-preview-dot"></span><div><b>Problem set 04</b><small>Mathematics · Due this week</small></div><i class